WEBVTT

00:00:11.460 --> 00:00:14.010
Previously on <i>Love Live! Superstar!!</i>

00:00:14.010 --> 00:00:15.800
I thought that my mother had regretted

00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:20.140
her school idol activities after being
unable to stop her school from closing.

00:00:20.140 --> 00:00:21.850
There's just nothing left!

00:00:21.850 --> 00:00:25.150
She didn't leave a single photo of
these supposed precious memories.

00:00:25.150 --> 00:00:26.480
How is that possible?!

00:00:26.480 --> 00:00:27.560
Shibuya-<i>san </i>and the others

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:28.730
did everything they could to find
anything they could about this.

00:00:28.730 --> 00:00:29.770
"The Jingu Music School
Idol Club Begins!!"
did everything they could to find
anything they could about this.

00:00:29.770 --> 00:00:30.650
"The Jingu Music School
Idol Club Begins!!"
And then...

00:00:30.650 --> 00:00:34.990
Being a school idol was
your mother's best memories.

00:00:34.990 --> 00:00:36.950
After finding out
what my mother truly felt,

00:00:36.950 --> 00:00:41.040
I decided to follow my dreams
along with Shibuya-<i>san </i>and the others.

00:00:47.290 --> 00:00:48.460
What's wrong?

00:00:48.460 --> 00:00:51.920
It's here... finally.

00:00:51.920 --> 00:00:55.840
I'm sure it's something about
how some school idol is ama-- Gala?!

00:00:55.840 --> 00:00:58.050
What, seriously, what is your problem?!

00:00:58.050 --> 00:01:00.220
It's here!

00:01:00.220 --> 00:01:04.270
It's finally, finally here!
This moment has arrived!

00:01:04.270 --> 00:01:07.400
The moment to risk our lives on!

00:01:14.070 --> 00:01:16.740
What in the world is this?

00:01:16.740 --> 00:01:18.280
It's finally going to start.

00:01:18.280 --> 00:01:22.120
The competition to decide who will be
the pinnacle of the school idol world!

00:01:22.120 --> 00:01:24.500
The Love Live.

00:01:24.500 --> 00:01:27.000
The Love Live!

00:01:27.460 --> 00:01:33.210
<i>You can't stop real dreams</i>

00:01:33.210 --> 00:01:38.890
<i>Our hearts are about to start running</i>

00:01:38.890 --> 00:01:43.140
"Love Live! Superstar!!"

00:01:55.320 --> 00:01:59.990
<i>Before we knew it,</i>
<i>we found something that we loved</i>

00:01:59.990 --> 00:02:03.490
<i>Let these feelings reach you</i>

00:02:03.490 --> 00:02:06.160
<i>We've made up our minds, we're serious!</i>

00:02:06.160 --> 00:02:08.960
<i>I wonder what we can do</i>

00:02:08.960 --> 00:02:10.880
<i>The sky's so bright</i>

00:02:10.880 --> 00:02:16.300
<i>Let's look up at it</i>
<i>and sing our hearts out</i>

00:02:16.300 --> 00:02:20.390
<i>Doesn't having something you want to do</i>

00:02:20.390 --> 00:02:23.050
<i>Make every day fun?</i>

00:02:23.050 --> 00:02:28.140
<i>Do you feel that way, too?</i>

00:02:28.140 --> 00:02:30.440
<i>Ah, we've been waiting for this moment</i>

00:02:30.440 --> 00:02:33.480
<i>This encounter is where we start</i>

00:02:33.480 --> 00:02:38.860
<i>Our dreams are drawn together,</i>
<i>and it all begins</i>

00:02:38.860 --> 00:02:44.660
<i>We realized our true desires and now,</i>
<i>we can't be stopped</i>

00:02:44.660 --> 00:02:50.040
<i>Our hearts are about to start running</i>

00:02:50.040 --> 00:02:55.880
<i>As fast as they can run</i>

00:02:57.550 --> 00:03:01.680
Lo...ve... Li...ve...

00:03:01.680 --> 00:03:04.260
We can finally enter!

00:03:04.260 --> 00:03:05.850
The Love Live, huh?

00:03:05.850 --> 00:03:09.020
So it's like what other clubs would
consider a national tournament.

00:03:09.020 --> 00:03:12.650
Oh, it's not that simple at all.

00:03:12.650 --> 00:03:16.820
The Love Live has been where countless
moving moments and miracles were created.

00:03:16.820 --> 00:03:20.150
For school idols,
it is the dream! The soul!

00:03:20.150 --> 00:03:22.530
It is what gives us life!

00:03:22.530 --> 00:03:25.240
I've heard that applicants
to some schools with school idols

00:03:25.240 --> 00:03:28.240
who have won the tournament have gone up.

00:03:28.240 --> 00:03:30.460
Yes! There are a number of schools

00:03:30.460 --> 00:03:33.420
that instantly became famous
after they were in danger of closing.

00:03:33.420 --> 00:03:36.250
Because of some amateur competition?

00:03:37.420 --> 00:03:40.220
I knew you would say something like that.

00:03:40.220 --> 00:03:42.590
Behold!

00:03:42.590 --> 00:03:44.840
This is where this year's...

00:03:44.840 --> 00:03:47.180
...finals will take place!

00:03:47.180 --> 00:03:48.680
Wow...

00:03:48.680 --> 00:03:50.680
It's that big?

00:03:50.680 --> 00:03:56.560
Yes. Finally... Finally, it's going to
take place at Jingu Stadium.

00:03:56.560 --> 00:03:58.150
Here?

00:04:01.320 --> 00:04:05.450
This is where I'll have the attention of
tens of thousands of people upon me?

00:04:05.450 --> 00:04:07.660
Arena!

00:04:07.660 --> 00:04:10.500
Galaxy!

00:04:12.500 --> 00:04:14.710
The moment I'll finally have
the spotlight on me...

00:04:14.710 --> 00:04:18.590
The moment I dreamed of
ever since I was a child...

00:04:18.590 --> 00:04:19.800
Hey!

00:04:19.800 --> 00:04:24.010
It's not going to be
that easy, you doofus.

00:04:24.010 --> 00:04:24.970
Doof?!

00:04:24.970 --> 00:04:27.550
What do you mean?

00:04:27.550 --> 00:04:29.470
Huh? Ren-<i>chan</i>?

00:04:29.470 --> 00:04:33.480
Hm... Hm?!

00:04:33.480 --> 00:04:34.940
What is it?

00:04:34.940 --> 00:04:37.860
Ren-<i>chan</i>, something seems off...

00:04:39.270 --> 00:04:41.280
Hey! She's wearing
the general curriculum uniform!

00:04:41.280 --> 00:04:42.070
That's it!

00:04:42.070 --> 00:04:45.320
Even you switched over
to the general curriculum?

00:04:45.320 --> 00:04:48.830
No. It's just that the director
proposed to allow the students

00:04:48.830 --> 00:04:51.290
to wear which ever uniform they'd like,

00:04:51.290 --> 00:04:53.410
rather than dividing them
through programs.

00:04:53.410 --> 00:04:57.830
I see! Maybe I'll have
a music program uniform made.

00:04:57.830 --> 00:04:59.590
Why don't we all try it on together?

00:04:59.590 --> 00:05:01.630
Hey, that'll be super fun!

00:05:01.630 --> 00:05:02.710
Hey!

00:05:02.710 --> 00:05:05.380
Where did this conversation go?!

00:05:06.300 --> 00:05:08.850
This year's Love Live
will truly be difficult.

00:05:08.850 --> 00:05:11.890
The popularity of school idols
is continuously growing,

00:05:11.890 --> 00:05:13.810
and the number of schools
that enter every year

00:05:13.810 --> 00:05:16.100
also surpasses the previous year's record.

00:05:16.100 --> 00:05:20.730
There are only a few schools
that reach that stage of dreams.

00:05:20.730 --> 00:05:24.780
I don't think our chances
are actually that bad though.

00:05:24.780 --> 00:05:26.990
Kanon-<i>chan</i>'s songs and
singing ability are amazing.

00:05:26.990 --> 00:05:31.030
And Chi-<i>chan</i>'s actually won
at a dancing competition.

00:05:31.030 --> 00:05:33.870
Ren-<i>chan</i>'s done figure skating and piano.

00:05:33.870 --> 00:05:37.210
Sumire-<i>chan </i>has experience
being on stage ever since she was little.

00:05:37.210 --> 00:05:40.250
And Keke-<i>chan</i>'s passion
is our ultimate weapon.

00:05:40.250 --> 00:05:43.630
I'm not sure if we'll win, but maybe
we could make it to the prelims...

00:05:43.630 --> 00:05:45.760
You're too naïve!

00:05:45.760 --> 00:05:49.010
Super... naïve...!

00:05:49.010 --> 00:05:51.970
Super naïve. Super naïve!

00:05:51.970 --> 00:05:54.560
--Ultra, super naïve!
--Why do you seem different?

00:05:54.560 --> 00:05:56.640
I will enter us, but just know
that to blast through,

00:05:56.640 --> 00:06:01.150
we'll need a magnificent song and
an incredibly powerful performance.

00:06:01.150 --> 00:06:02.820
Be prepared!

00:06:02.820 --> 00:06:05.240
It has to be a new song, right?

00:06:05.240 --> 00:06:08.030
Okay, Kanon-<i>chan</i>, write the lyrics.

00:06:08.030 --> 00:06:10.240
And you want me to compose?

00:06:10.240 --> 00:06:11.070
Is that a no?

00:06:11.070 --> 00:06:15.250
Well, there're five of us now and
I think that'll give us new direction.

00:06:15.250 --> 00:06:18.330
Well, I'm sure I can
come up with something...

00:06:18.330 --> 00:06:20.920
Make sure it's flashy and elegant.

00:06:23.920 --> 00:06:25.510
What's wrong?

00:06:28.680 --> 00:06:28.970
"School Name:
Yuigaoka Girls' High School"

00:06:28.680 --> 00:06:28.970
"Group Name:"

00:06:28.970 --> 00:06:32.430
"School Name:
Yuigaoka Girls' High School"
"Group Name:"

00:06:28.970 --> 00:06:32.430
Yuigaoka School Idol Club...

00:06:32.430 --> 00:06:33.430
"Required"

