that's overflowing with circles.

00:07:31.150 --> 00:07:33.450
I'm so happy.

00:07:33.450 --> 00:07:35.160
Maru... Circle...

00:07:35.160 --> 00:07:37.700
Yeah! Everything starts from a circle!

00:07:37.700 --> 00:07:41.160
It's the world's greatest mystery
and the beginning of all life!

00:07:41.160 --> 00:07:46.960
Yes! Manholes! Balls! Manmaru's eyes!
A drop of water! The moon!

00:07:46.960 --> 00:07:48.920
The earth! The sun!

00:07:48.920 --> 00:07:53.430
All of it! It all goes round and round
and round! Everything is a circle!

00:07:55.220 --> 00:07:57.760
Do you have anything, Ren-<i>chan</i>?

00:07:57.760 --> 00:07:58.930
Did you just ignore me?

00:07:58.930 --> 00:08:01.140
I-I can't say that I do...

00:08:01.140 --> 00:08:03.900
