00:08:38.850 --> 00:08:40.890
Do you think people will do it?

00:08:40.890 --> 00:08:43.560
I doubt there'll be anything
decent even if they do.

00:08:43.560 --> 00:08:47.440
Don't worry! If we just
leave this here, by the weekend...

00:08:48.400 --> 00:08:49.610
Nothing...

00:08:49.610 --> 00:08:51.400
