after the school festival.

00:09:05.750 --> 00:09:08.750
Then I wonder why...

00:09:08.750 --> 00:09:10.000
Your group name?

00:09:10.000 --> 00:09:13.010
Yes. We actually don't have one yet.

00:09:13.010 --> 00:09:16.220
Oh, I guess you never mentioned it.

00:09:16.220 --> 00:09:19.100
One of our fans came up with our name.

00:09:19.100 --> 00:09:22.270
Yes. They just suggested it to us.

00:09:22.270 --> 00:09:25.520
Well, you two are pretty popular.

00:09:25.520 --> 00:09:28.230
Actually, back then, we really weren't.

00:09:28.230 --> 00:09:31.020
We were just trying to
get people to remember us

00:09:31.020 --> 00:09:33.230
by putting up videos and stuff.

00:09:33.230 --> 00:09:34.440
Videos...

00:09:34.440 --> 00:09:35.900
Stream?

00:09:35.900 --> 00:09:39.780
Yeah. Apparently school idols
don't only sing or dance.

00:09:39.780 --> 00:09:41.790
They do all sorts of other things.

00:09:41.790 --> 00:09:44.660
I guess we only have our songs up.

00:09:44.660 --> 00:09:50.090
I was careless. I was so busy
thinking about the Love Live...

00:09:50.090 --> 00:09:52.050
Um...

00:09:52.050 --> 00:09:54.510
I do apologize if this is
a rather silly question...

00:09:54.510 --> 00:09:57.550
But what exactly is video streaming?

00:09:58.390 --> 00:10:02.100
Are we handing videos out somewhere...?

00:10:02.100 --> 00:10:03.600
Wait...

00:10:03.600 --> 00:10:05.730
Ren-<i>chan</i>, you really don't know?

00:10:05.730 --> 00:10:11.610
Yes. I was told to stay
far away from such things.

00:10:11.610 --> 00:10:14.570
Okay, then let's give it a try.

00:10:16.150 --> 00:10:18.110
"Title" "Visibility"
"Stream Quality" "Thumbnail"

