This is video streaming?

00:10:18.110 --> 00:10:21.950
We're going to film with this and have
people from all around the world watch

00:10:21.950 --> 00:10:24.580
so that they'll remember
the school idols from Yuigaoka.

00:10:24.580 --> 00:10:28.370
Then someone will probably
come up with a good name.

00:10:28.370 --> 00:10:28.960
"Title" "Visibility"
"Stream Quality" "Thumbnail"

