What in the world is this?!

00:10:57.360 --> 00:11:02.120
People watching you are sending messages.
Try replying to them.

00:11:04.620 --> 00:11:06.160
"So cute"...

00:11:06.160 --> 00:11:07.950
"You're beautiful."

00:11:07.950 --> 00:11:10.170
"Your hairstyle is lovely"...

00:11:10.170 --> 00:11:13.670
Honestly! Please don't
start this out of nowhere!

00:11:13.670 --> 00:11:15.550
We were just testing things out.

00:11:15.550 --> 00:11:17.090
Please shut this off immediately!

00:11:17.090 --> 00:11:19.220
What?!

00:11:19.220 --> 00:11:22.760
Okay, are you ready? Do you know
what you're going to say?

00:11:22.760 --> 00:11:23.930
All set!

00:11:23.930 --> 00:11:27.140
You should have let me properly
prepare like this to begin with.

00:11:27.140 --> 00:11:29.270
Okay, here we go!

00:11:29.270 --> 00:11:30.190
Wait a moment.

00:11:30.190 --> 00:11:31.060
Huh?

00:11:31.060 --> 00:11:34.610
What about you, Kanon-<i>san</i>?
Are you not going to be filmed?

00:11:34.610 --> 00:11:37.360
Huh? Me?

00:11:37.360 --> 00:11:38.860
I'm filming?

00:11:38.860 --> 00:11:41.150
You're filming?

00:11:41.150 --> 00:11:44.620
That's not fair
after you forced us to do this.

00:11:44.620 --> 00:11:46.080
Precisely!

00:11:46.080 --> 00:11:47.330
Yeah, yeah!

00:11:50.250 --> 00:11:56.960
Hello. We're the school idols
from Yuigaoka Girls' High.

00:11:56.960 --> 00:11:59.460
First, we'll introduce ourselves.

00:11:59.460 --> 00:12:04.180
W-We are doing school idol
activities at Yuigaoka...

00:12:04.180 --> 00:12:06.810
Actually, this is embarrassing,
so let's stop.

00:12:06.810 --> 00:12:08.310
Who do you think you are?!

00:12:08.310 --> 00:12:10.890
--Ow, ow, ow!
--Did you really just say that?

00:12:10.890 --> 00:12:12.440
Hey, we're on camera.

00:12:12.440 --> 00:12:13.770
Chisato!

00:12:14.600 --> 00:12:17.480
Circles, circles, circles!

00:12:17.480 --> 00:12:19.230
--Go!
--Huh?

00:12:19.230 --> 00:12:22.450
Uh... I... ♬ Giant isopod! ♬

00:12:22.450 --> 00:12:25.120
