00:12:42.840 --> 00:12:44.720
What? Me?!

00:12:44.720 --> 00:12:47.180
And we couldn't practice at all today

00:12:47.180 --> 00:12:49.390
because of all this fuss
over our name and stream.

00:12:49.390 --> 00:12:51.930
Let's forget about the name for now

00:12:51.930 --> 00:12:54.890
and we'll need to start properly
practicing again tomorrow.

00:12:54.890 --> 00:12:57.190
So, are you done with the song yet?

00:12:57.190 --> 00:12:58.150
Song?

00:12:58.150 --> 00:13:01.440
Oh, right. Kanon-<i>san </i>was
supposed to come up with lyrics.

00:13:01.440 --> 00:13:04.530
Huh? But the music comes first.

00:13:04.530 --> 00:13:07.530
I thought I was supposed to
compose after the lyrics.

00:13:07.530 --> 00:13:12.580
No way. I was going to write the lyrics
after the music was done...

00:13:15.830 --> 00:13:18.920
What?!

00:13:20.460 --> 00:13:23.470
<i>Love Live! Superstar!!</i>

00:13:23.470 --> 00:13:26.510
Eyes up front! No wobbling!

00:13:26.510 --> 00:13:30.760
Just five more seconds! Three! Two! One!

00:13:30.760 --> 00:13:32.430
And done.

00:13:34.810 --> 00:13:37.020
Next, we're going to do some jazz dancing

00:13:37.020 --> 00:13:37.650
--and then do three sets
of situps and squats.

00:13:37.650 --> 00:13:39.690
--My legs are stiff.
--and then do three sets
of situps and squats.

00:13:39.690 --> 00:13:41.110
Really?!

00:13:41.110 --> 00:13:43.490
We're basically an athletic club.

00:13:43.490 --> 00:13:44.860
What did you expect?

00:13:44.860 --> 00:13:46.780
We don't have a song,
or any choreography done,

00:13:46.780 --> 00:13:48.910
so we just have to cover the basics.

00:13:48.910 --> 00:13:51.990
Are we really going to make it in time?

00:13:51.990 --> 00:13:53.410
Well...

00:13:56.750 --> 00:14:00.130
Stare...

00:14:00.130 --> 00:14:02.380
I know! I know, okay?!

00:14:02.380 --> 00:14:06.590
But if it's supposed to be a song that
represents our group and the school,

00:14:06.590 --> 00:14:07.800
it get's pretty hard...

00:14:07.800 --> 00:14:10.800
I don't think you need to
think that hard on it.

00:14:10.800 --> 00:14:16.310
Correct! Just put the feelings you feel
when you see the five of us into a song!

00:14:16.310 --> 00:14:17.560
Okay, then let me ask.

00:14:17.560 --> 00:14:21.690
Keke-<i>chan</i>, what do you feel
when you see the five of us?

00:14:21.690 --> 00:14:25.150
Well, um...

00:14:25.150 --> 00:14:31.070
Like we're supreme...
The best... Excellent...

00:14:31.070 --> 00:14:32.740
Or perhaps not.

00:14:32.740 --> 00:14:34.240
See?

00:14:34.240 --> 00:14:37.620
Well, obviously, we're clearly
nothing but galaxy.

00:14:37.620 --> 00:14:39.830
What? I'm pretty sure we're circles.

00:14:39.830 --> 00:14:42.130
I mean our name is
Maru Maru Circle after all.

00:14:42.130 --> 00:14:44.130
We've declined that name.

00:14:44.130 --> 00:14:46.340
Then what exactly is our name?

00:14:46.340 --> 00:14:47.720
Well...

00:14:47.720 --> 00:14:50.140
See? You're all in the same boat as me.

00:14:50.140 --> 00:14:53.510
This is hard. We're all pretty different,

00:14:53.510 --> 00:14:57.310
and it's not like we all first came together
with a common goal or anything.

00:14:57.310 --> 00:15:00.150
Yes, that's quite understandable, but...

00:15:00.150 --> 00:15:03.270
But we don't have
that much more time to enter.

00:15:03.270 --> 00:15:05.190
Are we going to give up?

00:15:05.190 --> 00:15:07.360
Of course, we aren't!

00:15:07.360 --> 00:15:09.110
In that case...

00:15:09.110 --> 00:15:10.450
Yes...?

00:15:10.450 --> 00:15:12.490
In that case...

00:15:13.740 --> 00:15:15.540
What is this?

00:15:15.540 --> 00:15:17.410
The Japanese art of room confinement!

00:15:17.410 --> 00:15:19.910
You're not leaving until
you think of something!

00:15:23.340 --> 00:15:27.630
That's not fair. Why is it all on me?

00:15:47.360 --> 00:15:49.610
What's this over here?"

00:15:49.610 --> 00:15:52.700
Wow! A giant bed!

00:15:52.700 --> 00:15:54.700
Hup!

00:15:54.700 --> 00:15:56.660
It's so fluffy!

00:15:56.660 --> 00:16:01.290
I've always wanted to sleep on
a bed like this! Rolly roll!

00:16:01.290 --> 00:16:03.630
Zzz...

00:16:05.590 --> 00:16:08.050
Kanon-<i>chan</i>.

00:16:08.050 --> 00:16:09.880
Are you done with the song yet?

00:16:09.880 --> 00:16:11.130
Chi-<i>chan</i>.

00:16:11.130 --> 00:16:12.260
Keke-<i>chan</i>?!

00:16:12.260 --> 00:16:14.340
It appears...

00:16:14.340 --> 00:16:17.760
...that you'll need some supervision.

00:16:17.760 --> 00:16:20.640
Stare...

00:16:23.230 --> 00:16:25.610
Um, uh...

00:16:25.610 --> 00:16:27.650
Yes?

00:16:28.780 --> 00:16:31.780
Oh! It's Maru Maru Galaxy!

00:16:35.240 --> 00:16:36.240
Ow!

00:16:37.490 --> 00:16:39.160
What the?

00:16:41.580 --> 00:16:45.500
Ch-Chibi... It's been a while.

00:16:47.460 --> 00:16:50.090
No!

00:16:51.920 --> 00:16:54.010
So that's what happened.

00:16:54.010 --> 00:16:56.010
That must've been rough.

00:16:56.010 --> 00:16:58.300
I can't believe you have to
do it all by yourself.

00:16:58.300 --> 00:16:59.560
I know, right?!

00:16:59.560 --> 00:17:02.640
Not to mention, they're like,
you should write the lyrics!

00:17:02.640 --> 00:17:05.060
And, "I can't come up with
music without lyrics!"

00:17:05.060 --> 00:17:07.520
They're relying on me too much!

00:17:07.520 --> 00:17:08.400
Morning!

00:17:08.400 --> 00:17:10.280
Ah, Kanon!

00:17:10.280 --> 00:17:12.240
Are you done with the lyrics?

00:17:12.240 --> 00:17:14.900
Well, actually...

00:17:14.900 --> 00:17:16.610
But yesterday...

00:17:16.610 --> 00:17:18.830
I thought of them so we're good!

00:17:18.830 --> 00:17:20.660
I'll write the rest at home!

00:17:20.660 --> 00:17:22.660
Isn't that what you said?

00:17:22.660 --> 00:17:26.830
Well, I mean, I figured you wouldn't
let me go home otherwise.

00:17:26.830 --> 00:17:31.550
You lied to us?! Then you're
no better than this giant isopod!

00:17:31.550 --> 00:17:32.840
Stop saying that so casually!

00:17:32.840 --> 00:17:35.970
Oh, come on. Kanon-<i>chan </i>is doing her best.

00:17:35.970 --> 00:17:39.550
Yeah. Not to mention,
I know how Kanon-<i>chan </i>feels.

00:17:39.550 --> 00:17:43.100
It's really hard to round
all of you up into one image.

00:17:43.100 --> 00:17:44.140
You think so?

00:17:44.140 --> 00:17:47.520
You know how you all were
asking for name suggestions?

00:17:47.520 --> 00:17:50.480
We were all talking about it...

00:17:50.480 --> 00:17:52.610
But couldn't come up with anything.

00:17:52.610 --> 00:17:58.910
Yeah. You're all just getting started,
so you're still a blank slate.

00:17:58.910 --> 00:18:03.700
This might sound mean,
but you have no distinguishing features.

00:18:04.950 --> 00:18:05.790
See you later.

00:18:05.790 --> 00:18:07.170
Bye!

00:18:10.590 --> 00:18:15.380
We're not exactly a bunch of
talented stars who got together either...

00:18:15.380 --> 00:18:17.340
But we're not all ordinary people

00:18:17.340 --> 00:18:21.300
who came together to overcome something...

00:18:21.300 --> 00:18:25.230
Meaning our chances at succeeding
in show business are nonexistent.

00:18:25.230 --> 00:18:30.020
We're in the warring states area of school
idols right now. We stand no chance.

00:18:30.020 --> 00:18:31.480
You think so?

00:18:34.230 --> 00:18:35.240
Kanon-<i>chan</i>?

00:18:35.240 --> 00:18:37.490
I'm going to skip practice today.

00:18:37.490 --> 00:18:38.910
That's rather sudden.

00:18:38.910 --> 00:18:42.530
I think I might've come up with something
with what we were talking about.

00:18:42.530 --> 00:18:45.580
You mean lyrics? Or our group name?

00:18:45.580 --> 00:18:51.790
I don't know, but... All of it!

00:18:51.790 --> 00:18:52.670
All of it?

00:18:52.670 --> 00:18:57.340
Yeah. I think I figured out
exactly what the five of us are.

00:18:57.340 --> 00:18:58.840
Kanon-<i>chan</i>!

00:18:59.970 --> 00:19:02.260
Sorry we always rely on you.

00:19:02.260 --> 00:19:06.100
No. I'm sorry I'm taking so long, too.

00:19:06.100 --> 00:19:08.100
But I think I finally found the answer!

00:19:08.100 --> 00:19:10.440
You look pretty certain.

00:19:10.440 --> 00:19:12.440
Then let us practice!

00:19:12.440 --> 00:19:15.690
Let's start with running! Follow me!

00:19:15.690 --> 00:19:17.940
You always pass out.

00:19:18.860 --> 00:19:25.330
<i>I wonder who just answered my question</i>

00:19:25.330 --> 00:19:29.710
<i>I just can't stay still</i>

00:19:29.710 --> 00:19:34.790
<i>The weather's so nice in the city</i>

00:19:34.790 --> 00:19:38.840
<i>I think something's about to happen</i>

00:19:38.840 --> 00:19:41.800
<i>Eventually, I end up running</i>

00:19:41.800 --> 00:19:46.640
<i>I have a feeling I'll</i>
<i>coincidentally run into you</i>

00:19:46.640 --> 00:19:48.730
<i>Listen, hey, listen!</i>

00:19:48.730 --> 00:19:52.400
<i>I want to start today</i>

00:19:52.400 --> 00:19:56.360
<i>Ah, but I just can't find</i>
<i>the right words yet</i>

00:19:56.360 --> 00:19:59.650
<i>Forever (Dreaming) in my heart (Dreaming)</i>

00:19:59.650 --> 00:20:00.490
<i>Forever (Dreaming) in my heart (Dreaming)</i>
"Hey Hey!"

00:20:00.490 --> 00:20:01.070
<i>I've always had this Dreaming Energy</i>
"Hey Hey!"

00:20:01.070 --> 00:20:03.950
<i>I've always had this Dreaming Energy</i>

00:20:03.950 --> 00:20:06.030
<i>Listen, hey, listen!</i>

00:20:06.030 --> 00:20:13.170
<i>I want to start today</i>
<i>so I want to tell you immediately</i>

00:20:13.170 --> 00:20:17.750
<i>If we all connect</i>

00:20:17.750 --> 00:20:20.590
<i>We can really have some fun;</i>
<i>I just know it!</i>

00:20:20.590 --> 00:20:21.880
<i>We can really have some fun;</i>
<i>I just know it!</i>
"School Idol Club"

00:20:21.880 --> 00:20:25.800
<i>We can really have some fun;</i>
<i>I just know it!</i>

00:20:29.020 --> 00:20:30.390
Well?

00:20:31.640 --> 00:20:33.270
I think it's great!

00:20:33.270 --> 00:20:37.020
I believe these lyrics accurately
despite who we are right now.

00:20:37.020 --> 00:20:40.780
Thanks! Also, I thought up a group name!

00:20:40.780 --> 00:20:43.820
"Nebula Girls!" "Circle"
"Transcendent Mother Goddess" "Galaxy!"

00:20:44.570 --> 00:20:46.870
"Liella!"?

00:20:46.870 --> 00:20:50.950
I tried to base it off of the French word
"relier" which means to connect.

00:20:50.950 --> 00:20:56.290
You know, because Ren-<i>chan</i>'s mother
wanted all of our feelings to connect

00:20:56.290 --> 00:20:58.250
when she named this school.

00:20:58.250 --> 00:20:59.210
Yes.

00:20:59.210 --> 00:21:03.260
We can do the same as school idols.

00:21:03.260 --> 00:21:07.680
And I was hoping we could all be connected
through various colors of light.

00:21:07.680 --> 00:21:09.560
Light...

00:21:14.020 --> 00:21:17.360
Red, blue, green...

00:21:17.360 --> 00:21:20.070
Through being connected and tied together,

00:21:20.070 --> 00:21:24.900
we'll become a light filled with
different colors we could never imagine.

00:21:24.900 --> 00:21:29.660
And that's only possible because
we don't have any colors yet.

00:21:29.660 --> 00:21:33.290
Because we come from this school
that's only just begun.

00:21:33.290 --> 00:21:35.460
Because we're us...

00:21:35.460 --> 00:21:37.540
That's not a bad idea.

00:21:37.540 --> 00:21:39.090
"Liella!"...

00:21:39.090 --> 00:21:40.460
"Liella!"...

00:21:40.460 --> 00:21:41.380
"Liella!"...

00:21:41.380 --> 00:21:42.840
"Liella!"...

00:21:44.090 --> 00:21:45.470
"Liella!"...

00:21:49.930 --> 00:21:52.720
Okay, now that that's settled...

00:21:52.720 --> 00:21:53.890
Hiyah!

00:21:57.650 --> 00:22:02.440
We're Yuigaoka High's
school idols! Liella!

00:22:02.440 --> 00:22:05.150
I told you this was too big!

00:22:05.150 --> 00:22:08.950
This is perfect! We have to
keep getting even more famous!

00:22:08.950 --> 00:22:10.620
We have to win.

00:22:10.620 --> 00:22:11.790
Yeah!

00:22:13.660 --> 00:22:17.540
Okay, everyone. I'm going to enter us!

00:22:17.540 --> 00:22:20.040
Our name is...

00:22:20.040 --> 00:22:21.420
Liella!

00:22:21.420 --> 00:22:22.000
"Group Name:
Liella!"

00:22:25.340 --> 00:22:28.930
<i>The future is calling to us</i>

00:22:28.930 --> 00:22:31.760
<i>Like the wind</i>

00:22:31.760 --> 00:22:37.980
<i>No one knows what the future holds for us</i>

00:22:39.400 --> 00:22:42.320
<i>Even then, we want to move forward</i>

00:22:42.320 --> 00:22:45.820
<i>Because we don't want to have any regrets</i>

00:22:45.820 --> 00:22:49.450
<i>You can't hold down our hearts</i>

00:22:49.450 --> 00:22:53.620
<i>Let's all be free</i>

00:22:53.620 --> 00:22:57.080
<i>We're not going to give up!</i>

00:22:57.080 --> 00:23:00.670
<i>Because we decided that</i>

00:23:00.670 --> 00:23:03.710
<i>We'll cry, laugh, and do our best</i>

00:23:03.710 --> 00:23:08.050
<i>We all want to surpass our limits</i>

00:23:08.050 --> 00:23:12.300
<i>It's important to believe</i>

00:23:12.300 --> 00:23:15.850
<i>And once we told ourselves that</i>

00:23:15.850 --> 00:23:22.860
<i>Let's try to go even further</i>

00:23:22.860 --> 00:23:30.610
<i>We may be small, but we have big dreams</i>

00:23:30.610 --> 00:23:37.700
<i>We won't give in, now, let's fly together</i>

00:23:37.700 --> 00:23:45.300
<i>Let's fly the best we can,</i>
<i>now, let's fly together</i>

00:23:47.380 --> 00:23:50.340
Next time, "Check It Out!!"
